This repo uses Product-Helper.

- If `.product-helper/` is missing, run `npx product-helper init`.
- After a feature, you update TaskTrack, PRODUCT.md, and TIMELINE.md. Feature cards only.
- Move cards Later → Planned → In progress. Do not dump every card in one column.
- First look is thorough. Wait for live pages. Fill SEO: meta description, favicons, load times.
- Do not ask the human to run `sync` or move cards.
- Always tell them: `npx product-helper open`.
- They read. You write. They accept Done.
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/product-helper/SKILL.md`
